      "vipSummary": {
        "id": 1448638861,
        "html": "<p>Factor V is an essential coagulation cofactor that enhances thrombin activation by factor Xa. Genetic variant of F5 (Factor V Leiden (FVL) polymorphism) has been associated with risk of venous thromboembolism (VTE).</p>\n",
